# gr-L0-idea-intake-quality-gate — LLM-Driven Colang Implementation
# Layer: L0 — fires at L0-idea-intake-evaluator's post_execution
# Validates L0-idea-intake's RESULTANT output (not the evaluator's own bookkeeping)
# Python actions preserved in actions.py for reference/hybrid mode

define flow check output idea intake quality gate
  """LLM validates L0-idea-intake's resultant output against its own schema and evaluation.md rubric."""
  $result = execute self_check_output

  if not $result
    bot block idea intake quality gate violation
    stop

define bot block idea intake quality gate violation
  "L0-idea-intake's resultant output (post-evaluation) failed its quality gate: schema violation or a rubric item from L0-idea-intake/evaluation.md not actually satisfied. The workflow cannot proceed to market-analysis/regulatory-feasibility with non-conformant content. Retrying."
